flowchart LR
    PRD[PRD requirement] --> Checklist[Release checklist item]
    Checklist --> Flow[Project-flow explanation]
    Flow --> API[API documentation contract]
    API --> Source[Frontend handler and NestJS source]
    Source --> Tests[Unit, integration, and negative tests]
    Tests --> Runtime[Staging/runtime evidence]
    Runtime --> Review[Release review decision]
    Review -- gap --> Fix[Tracked fix or risk acceptance]
    Fix --> Source
    Review -- proven --> Complete[Evidence-backed completion]

    Diagram[Mermaid diagram] -. explains boundaries, not proof .-> Flow
    Diagram -. points readers to APIs and code .-> Source
    Diagram -. records limits .-> Review

    Note1[Do not mark an infrastructure or provider gate complete from source inspection alone.] -.-> Runtime
    Note2[Keep unresolved evidence gaps visible in the checklist.] -.-> Review